            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_32",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Siddry",
            text: _("My name is Siddry. These cursed saurians nabbed me a week ago — wanted me to turn overseer to their other slaves. I wouldn’t do it, so they caged me with them. They tried to take my bow too, but they had some trouble with that."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kai Krellis",
            text: _("So, you will help us defeat them?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Siddry",
            text: _("The way I see it, you’re helping me. There is nothing I would like better than to put their slavery to an end. I can’t swim, so I won’t be able to come with you on your travels, but I will owe you. If there is anything I can do in the future, I will do it."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kai Krellis",
            text: _("Well met, then, friend. I am Kai Krellis, leader of the people of Jotha."),
          },
        ],
